				Time="2011-07-28T08:37:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>四天王：悪
ギーマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
